# Moziketo Downloader

Ingest microservice for موزیکتو. Pairs with [moziketo-wave](https://github.com/danielhej/moziketo-wave).

## Server

- SSH: `ssh moz-downloader` → `/opt/moz-downloader`
- VPS: `130.185.120.239` · user `deploy`
- systemd: `moz-downloader` on port `8787`

## Stack

FastAPI · yt-dlp · spotdl · boto3 (Arvan S3)

## Rules

- Auth: `X-Moziketo-Relay-Secret` on all routes
- Spotify metadata: pass `title`+`artist` or configure Spotify Client Credentials
- S3 keys: `music/{filename}.mp3`
- Public URL base: `https://dl.moziketo.ir/music`
- Conventional commits; commit only when user asks
